&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help shape how PlayStation measures product and commercial success across a global business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
