&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Remote Status:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully Remote (#LI-Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LivePerson (NASDAQ: LPSN) is a leader in trusted enterprise conversational AI and digital transformation. The world&#39;s leading brands use our award-winning Conversational Cloud platform to connect with millions of consumers. We power nearly a billion conversational interactions every month, providing uniquely rich data analytics and safety tools to unlock the power of conversational AI for better business outcomes. Fast Company named LivePerson the #1 Most Innovative AI Company in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LivePerson is seeking a strategic, customer-focused &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director of Customer Experience (CX) Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to help the world&#39;s leading brands transform how they engage customers through AI-powered conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role partners directly with executive stakeholders at enterprise brands to define and execute their long-term Customer Experience (CX) vision using LivePerson&#39;s Conversational &lt;strong&gt;Growth Path (CGP) Maturity Model&lt;/strong&gt;. The Director will guide customers from foundational automation through advanced AI-driven customer engagement, creating measurable business outcomes across customer satisfaction, operational efficiency, and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to customer strategy, this leader will own LivePerson&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Data Analytics and Conversational Design &lt;/strong&gt;organizations to deliver insight-driven recommendations and exceptional conversational experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible leadership role that combines executive consulting, AI strategy, analytics, experience design, and organizational leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will: Key Responsibilities &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
