&lt;li&gt;Partner with the LivePerson Sales and Success organization on Brands long term strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with LivePerson Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams to provide Brand requirements and be the interface for new product introductions testing and validation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead customer workshops to assess current capabilities using LivePerson&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Conversational Growth Path (CGP) Maturity Model.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop multi-year CX roadmaps that align AI investments with business objectives, customer outcomes, and operational KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor on conversational AI, automation, agent experience, customer engagement, and digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer business priorities into strategic initiatives leveraging the LivePerson platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational Growth Path (CGP)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
