&lt;li&gt;Build executive presentations and business cases demonstrating ROI and value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish measurable milestones that guide customers through increasing levels of conversational AI maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive executive alignment around roadmap priorities and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Customer Strategy Center of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide leadership for two strategic organizations:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
