&lt;li&gt;Deliver data-driven recommendations that improve containment, conversion, customer satisfaction, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success and Product teams to identify optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
